OL,3,APetrol and diesel price rises push UK
OL,4,Ainflation rate up to 3.1%
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rate of inflation rises to 3.1% in
OL,7,Fthe UK, according to the latest figures
OL,8,Ffrom the Office for National Statistics
OL,10,FEconomists had thought the figure would
OL,11,Fjump above 3%, after it reached 2.9%
OL,12,Flast month
OL,14,FWhat is inflation? It measures the
OL,15,Fincrease in the price of something over
OL,16,Ftime - the Bank of England has a target
OL,17,Fof keeping the rate at 2%
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
